{"_v":3,"id":"total-immediate-collective-imminent-terrestrial-salvation-west-end-2019","cat":"west-end","cs":82.66,"rc":8,"bd":{"positive":5,"mixed":3,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Mark Fisher","o":"The Guardian","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2019/aug/09/total-immediate-collective-imminent-terrestrial-salvation-review-edinburgh","d":"2019-08-09","q":"It was called Total Immediate Collective Imminent Terrestrial Salvation and we saw that it was good."},{"cn":"Jessie Thompson","o":"Evening Standard","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/total-immediate-collective-imminent-terrestrial-salvation-review-engrossing-and-inventive-a4230526.html","d":"2019-09-06","q":"Engrossing and inventive...the comforts of old-fashioned storytelling give way to anxieties about the future."},{"cn":"Aleks Sierz","o":"The Arts Desk","s":97,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://theartsdesk.com/theatre/total-immediate-collective-imminent-terrestrial-salvation-royal-court-review-brilliant-meta","d":"2019-09-06","q":"This is a brilliant meta-theatrical experiment."},{"cn":"Simon Jenner","o":"FringeReview","s":88,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://fringereview.co.uk/review/fringereview-uk/2019/total-immediate-collective-imminent-terrestrial-salvation/","d":"2019-09-06","q":"The most consistently satisfying work of Tim Crouch I've seen."},{"cn":"Liam O'Dell","o":"Liam O'Dell","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://liamodell.com/2019/09/19/total-immediate-collective-imminent-terrestrial-salvation-review-royal-court-theatre-london-tim-crouch-national-theatre-of-scotland-susan-vidler-line-of-duty-shyvonne-ahmmad-edinburgh-fringe-festival/","d":"2019-09-19","q":"Both on and off the page, Total Immediate Collective Imminent Salvation is ethereal and unnerving."},{"cn":null,"o":"Camden New Journal","s":74,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.camdennewjournal.co.uk/article/review-total-immediate-collective-imminent-terrestrial-salvation-at-th